        },
        {
          "text": "’Dinile indi Daudi pi ’ba asikari ongulumuru dri cepi ’diyi be co anzi Asafuni ma azi ’diyi pi ma esele ndu, anzi Hemanini pie, Yedutunini pie, azi inzitanisi, ’ba ngapi e’yo ecepi o’di pisi, afa zaburi ngozuri pie, aya cole cori pie ’diyi. ’Ba azi nde ’yepi ’diyi ma kalafe azi ngaza yini vusiri ndra ’dini: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asafu anzipi ma eselia: Zakuri pi, Yusufu pie, Netania pie, Asarela pie, yi anzi Asafuni, yi Asafu ma palaa, e’yo ecepi opini azilerile ’diyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yedu­tuni vile ’diyi, Yedutuni anzipi: Gedalia pi, Zed pi, Yesaya pi, Hasabia pi, Matitia pie, yi azia, yi dria yi ma ati Yedutuni ma palaa, eri’i e’yo nabiru ondri o’di be awa’di­fo fezu azini Yehovani inzizu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hemani vile ’diyi, Hemani anzipi: Bukia pi, Matania pi, Uzieli pi, Sebueli pi, Yerimoti pi, Hanania pi, Hanani pi, Eliata pi, Gidaliti pi, Romamiti-ezeri pi, Yosibekasa pi, Maloti pi, Hotiri pi, Mahazioti pie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
